  {%- comment -%} FAQ Section {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="bundles-faq">
    <div class="page-width">
      <h2 class="section-title">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

      <div class="faq-grid">
        <div class="faq-item">
          <h3>How does the 35% discount work?</h3>
          <p>Every bundle is priced at exactly 35% OFF the combined regular price of all included products. No exceptions.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
          <h3>Can I customize a bundle?</h3>
          <p>Pre-made bundles cannot be customized, but you can <a href="/pages/bundle-creator">build your own custom bundle</a> with 3-4 products and get the same 35% discount.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
          <h3>Is shipping free on bundles?</h3>
          <p>Yes! All bundles qualify for free shipping to the continental United States.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
          <h3>Can I return a bundle?</h3>
          <p>Yes, our standard 30-day return policy applies to all bundles. Individual items from bundles can be returned separately.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
          <h3>How were these bundles created?</h3>
          <p>Each bundle was curated by medical professionals based on patient needs, complementary product logic, and 2025 medical research.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
          <h3>Can I buy bundle products individually?</h3>
          <p>Yes, all products in bundles are available for individual purchase at regular prices. Bundles offer the best value.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
